msgstr "MyKNX 未为该项目颁发证书："

msgid "To export without it, choose 'Export Without Certificate' or the 'License with a Dongle' tab in the Sign Export window."
msgstr "如需不带证书导出，请在“签名导出”窗口中选择“不带证书导出”或“使用加密狗授权”选项卡。"

msgid "{name} cannot be imported."
msgstr "无法导入 {name}。"

msgid "The file was written, but it refers to product data that is not in the catalog: {references}. Add these products to the catalog and export again."
msgstr "文件已写入，但它引用了产品目录中没有的产品数据：{references}。请将这些产品添加到产品目录后重新导出。"

msgid "Sign Export"
msgstr "签名导出"

msgid "ETS 6: needs a licensed .knxproj through a MyKNX login or a dongle.\nETS 5: just use 'Export Without Certificate'."
msgstr "ETS 6：需要通过 MyKNX 登录或加密狗获得授权的 .knxproj。\nETS 5：只需使用“不带证书导出”。"

msgid "Sign with MyKNX Login"
msgstr "使用 MyKNX 登录签名"

msgid "License with a Dongle"
msgstr "使用加密狗授权"

msgid "ETS must not be running on any computer with this MyKNX account while you log in and export here."
msgstr "在此登录和导出期间，任何使用此 MyKNX 账户的计算机上都不得运行 ETS。"

msgid "MyKNX Username"
msgstr "MyKNX 用户名"

msgid "MyKNX Password"
msgstr "MyKNX 密码"

msgid "Log in"
msgstr "登录"

msgid "Complete sign-in in your browser. Code: {code}"
msgstr "请在浏览器中完成登录。代码：{code}"

msgid "Login failed (HTTP 401). Either the password is wrong, or this account uses two-factor authentication - the server does not say which."
msgstr "登录失败（HTTP 401）。可能是密码错误，也可能是此账户使用了双重身份验证——服务器不会说明是哪种情况。"

msgid "Re-enter Credentials"
msgstr "重新输入凭据"

msgid "Start 2FA Sign-In"
msgstr "开始 2FA 登录"

msgid "MyKNX OAuth Credentials (2FA)"
msgstr "MyKNX OAuth 凭据（2FA）"

msgid "Needed only for accounts with two-factor authentication. The 2FA sign-in opens in your browser automatically when a normal login is rejected. Enter the OAuth client id/secret, or extract them from your installed ETS: pick 'Knx.Ets.MyKnx.dll' from the ETS program folder (e.g. C:\\Program Files (x86)\\ETS6\\Knx.Ets.MyKnx.dll).\n\nAlternatively, if you have any licensed ETS installed, skip online signing entirely and use the local project store instead - see the 'License with a Dongle' tab."
msgstr "仅适用于启用了双重身份验证的账户。普通登录被拒绝时，2FA 登录会自动在浏览器中打开。请输入 OAuth 客户端 ID/密钥，或从已安装的 ETS 中提取：从 ETS 程序文件夹中选择“Knx.Ets.MyKnx.dll”（例如 C:\\Program Files (x86)\\ETS6\\Knx.Ets.MyKnx.dll）。\n\n或者，如果您安装了任何已授权的 ETS，可完全跳过在线签名，改用本地项目存储——参见“使用加密狗授权”选项卡。"

msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "客户端 ID"

msgid "Client Secret"
msgstr "客户端密钥"

